// Typecheck-only config for the test suite (see source/loader/tsconfig.tests.json
// for the rationale in full).
//
// The build config emits `src` with `rootDir: src`, so it cannot also include
// `tests` — which left the tests compiled only by vitest's esbuild transform, and
// esbuild strips types without checking them. A test could name a type that no
// longer exists while `build`, `test` and `lint` all stayed green.
//
// Closed here because #10 changed the shape of three event payloads, and the
// per-car fixture test is the thing asserting those shapes. A suite that is not
// typechecked is a poor guard for a type change.
{
  "extends": "../../tsconfig.base.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "noEmit": true
  },
  "include": ["src", "tests"]
}
